PhaseShift: FFLAGS write-after-write revert, SimX scoreboard only.
Applied ONLY to the third tree vortex-trees/psff (scripts/mk_vortex_tree.sh --patchset ps --name psff, then git apply --index). Never part of the base/ps patchsets.
RTL (VX_scoreboard.sv / VX_decode.sv) is NOT changed: the analogous RTL change would keep wr_xregs[XREG_0] out of ibf_xregs_mask for FPU ops and add a per-warp in-flight counter.

